		<title type="html"><![CDATA[r/c model airplane iOS app uses Bullet for crash simulation]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=30083#p30083"><![CDATA[
